    "description": "<p>The Dragon-Blood's prowess with the blade inspires those who fight at her side. This Charm permanently upgrades the Exalt's role as a special character in mass combat. While leading or fighting with a unit, the Exalt's personal melee attacks — those she makes as a special character — grant one automatic success to all melee attacks made by her unit on the same tick, as her fighting style demonstrates devastating technique. This benefit applies only when she is actively engaged in melee combat and the unit she supports makes a melee attack action on the same tick she does.</p>",
